    "body": "### Contact Details (e.g. Tox ID or email)\n\n_No response_\n\n### qTox Version\n\n1.18.3\n\n### Commit Hash\n\n_No response_\n\n### Toxcore Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Qt Version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Start qTox\n2. Play around with enabling and disabling \"keep chatlogs\"\n3. end with \"keep chat logs\" disabled\n4. message someone back and forth\n\n### Observed Behavior\n\nNow qTox do not show any message expect the last one in a live chat. It's hard to have a conversation like this\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\nAll messages of the live chat should be visible until tox is closed and started again\n\n### Reproducibility\n\nRarely\n\n### Operating System\n\nLinux\n\n### Operating System version/distro/name/etc.\n\nUbuntu 20.04\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\n\n```",
